<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou the sinner’s death hast died,</l><l>Thou for us wast crucified;</l><l>For our sins Thy flesh was torn,</l><l>Thou our penalty hast borne.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Savior, Surety, Lamb of God,</l><l>Thou hast bought us with Thy blood;</l><l>Thou hast wiped the debt away,</l><l>Nothing left for us to pay;</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Nothing left for us to bear,</l><l>Nothing left for us to share</l><l>But the pardon and the bliss,</l><l>But the love, the light, the peace.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>I to Thee will look and live,</l><l>And, in looking, praises give;</l><l>Looking lightens, looking heals,</l><l>Looking all the gladness seals.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Jesus, Savior, Son of God,</l><l>Bearer of the sinner’s load,</l><l>I would rise to Thee above,</l><l>I would look, and praise, and love.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
